==Variants==
{{Variant
|original = Jackie Peng
|Chief Peng
|An event-exclusive enemy introduced in [[Loving Labour (Monthly Event)|Loving Labor]].
|Hermit Peng
|An event-exclusive enemy introduced in [[Old Guys About Town (Monthly Event)|Old Guys About Town]].
|Zackie Peng
|A [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie]] variant of Jackie Peng, with much more health and attack power. Like most Zombies, he can burrow past cats and revives once with 50% HP.
|Star Peng
|A [[:Category:Starred Alien Enemies|Starred Alien]] variant of Jackie Peng. It has significantly increased stats and a 100% chance to warp cats backward.
|Condemned Peng
|An [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] variant of Jackie Peng. He has much higher stats, higher range, Area Attack, a 50% chance to slow units for 3 seconds and a guaranteed chance to create a Lv.3 [[Surge Attack]] upon death.
|Big Peng Z
|A [[:Category:Colossus Enemies|Colossus]] variant of Zackie Peng. Has surprisingly low attack power, but his Area Attacks carry a 50% Toxic effect and an [[Omni Strike]] that reaches up to 500 range.
|Madam Peng
|A [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]]/[[:Category:Kaijin Enemies|Kaijin]] Peng from the [[Anniversary/13th Year|13th Anniversary]]. Only stands at 130 range, but gains Area Attack and Omni Strikes that pierce up to 180, as well as a 33% chance for a 2-second freeze.
}}

