==Trivia==
*Jackie Peng's name is a play on ''[[wikipedia:Jackie Chan|Jackie Chan]]'' (a famous Chinese actor and martial artist) and ''penguin''.
*Due to his large eyebrows, Jackie Peng is most likely based on [[wikipedia:Crested penguin|crested penguins]] such as the [[wikipedia:Fiordland penguin|Fiordland penguin]], [[wikipedia:Erect-crested penguin|erect-crested penguin]] and [[wikipedia:Western rockhopper penguin|western rockhopper penguin]], which have distinctive crests resembling eyebrows. In [[Nyanko Defence Force]], the Dark UFO Peng's eyebrows were yellow like these crests.
*Unlike [[Zackie Peng]], Jackie Peng jumps facing sideways when attacking, whereas [[Zackie Peng]] jumps facing more towards the front when attacking.

